## Built in the Black Hills

Brink Design Co. is based in Rapid City and serves the Black Hills with security cameras, Wi-Fi networks, audio/video systems, and clean low-voltage cabling.

We are local. We answer the phone. We show up when we say we will.

## What We Do

- **Security Cameras** — No monthly fees, no cloud subscriptions. Your footage stays on your property.
- **Wi-Fi & Network Cabling** — Reliable coverage with clean, labeled cable runs and organized racks.
- **Church & Commercial AV** — Sound systems, projection, livestreaming, and controls your volunteers can actually use.
- **Smart Home** — Lighting, locks, thermostats, and multi-room audio that work together.

## Why People Choose Us

We don't sell subscriptions. We don't push unnecessary gear. We don't disappear after install day.

Our focus is on designing systems that fit the space, installing them cleanly and correctly, and leaving you with something you understand and can actually use.

If you care about clean work, clear communication, and doing things once instead of twice — we're a good fit.

